# Whether the app answers taps, as scripts/responds asks before every install: each tab takes its
# page, a row opens its page (beside Now, or over it folded) and it loads, and Calls, Tasks and
# Settings open from the bars and go Back.
launch /
shows home-list-now
tap tab-goals
shows home-list-goals
tap tab-feed
shows home-list-feed
tap tab-ideas
shows home-list-ideas
tap tab-now
shows home-list-now
tap home-row-*
shows task-pane|task-page
gone task-loading
shoot row
launch /
tap bar-calls
shows calls
tap bar-back
shows home-list-now
tap bar-tasks
shows tasks
gone tasks-loading
tap bar-back
shows home-list-now
tap bar-settings
shows settings-body
tap bar-back
shows home-list-now
shoot end
